{"4439870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bug Drop", "steam_appid": 4439870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/d0bcbd61ea955780dc524a5ed4838f5c.avif?t=1782236537\" width=640 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During development the demo will be continually updated with new content, heroes, abilities and weapons.  Play now for free, give feedback and help steer the direction of the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.mp4?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>High Octane Horde Survival</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss a grenade and blink to it, deliver a massive roundhouse kick, or slaughter them with a lightning whirlwind. Each hero has a unique set of active dash abilities that change how they play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.mp4?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Racing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the bugs and race your yellow convertible across 10 different biomes in an endless race against a UFO while jamming to some MIDI radio stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/f634e0023875322056870389b0997db3.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=138 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/f634e0023875322056870389b0997db3.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u><br><u>About</u><br>You saved the world. You took the victory cruise. You did the press tour, kissed the babies, signed the action figures, even ate the sandwich they named after you.  You literally just got back. The infestation is here, you have the hive queen coordinates, and you're the only one crazy enough to drop straight into the middle of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, slaughter the bugs in 10 minutes, and then kill the queen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique heroes with different starting abilities and movement dash sets -- kick enemies in the face, leap over the horde, or rip their souls out and put them to work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto attacking weapons let you focus on movement and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A random selection of upgrades each run means your build is never the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon and upgrade comes from chests on the battlefield -- no shops, no grinding, just loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different enemies to fight, elites, mini bosses, and the royals themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/4788b24f6d2941ccd2cd21b3f17af7b9.mp4?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>High Octane Horde Survival</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss a grenade and blink to it, deliver a massive roundhouse kick, or slaughter them with a lightning whirlwind. Each hero has a unique set of active dash abilities that change how they play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/56d30821069c9baddb194fefacb2204d.mp4?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><u>Racing</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the bugs and race your yellow convertible across 10 different biomes in an endless race against a UFO while jamming to some MIDI radio stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/f634e0023875322056870389b0997db3.poster.avif?t=1782236537\" width=138 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/extras/f634e0023875322056870389b0997db3.webm?t=1782236537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u></u><br><u>About</u><br>You saved the world. You took the victory cruise. You did the press tour, kissed the babies, signed the action figures, even ate the sandwich they named after you.  You literally just got back. The infestation is here, you have the hive queen coordinates, and you're the only one crazy enough to drop straight into the middle of it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in, slaughter the bugs in 10 minutes, and then kill the queen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique heroes with different starting abilities and movement dash sets -- kick enemies in the face, leap over the horde, or rip their souls out and put them to work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto attacking weapons let you focus on movement and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A random selection of upgrades each run means your build is never the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon and upgrade comes from chests on the battlefield -- no shops, no grinding, just loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of different enemies to fight, elites, mini bosses, and the royals themselves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fight, upgrade, and survive in a fast-paced top-down action roguelite where 20 unique heroes with special traits, weapons and abilities take on the swarm of alien bugs.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/3bd21c8adb675bdf91953a9fb84610bc61069233/header.jpg?t=1782236537", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/e2d94bd966209a135dd30184d562fe8755419b42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782236537", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4439870/e2d94bd966209a135dd30184d562fe8755419b42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782236537", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / Ryzen 3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["These Are Serious Games"], "publishers": ["These